  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uniS9UM.png\" width=\"1127\" height=\"276\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/52LU4mv.png\" width=\"86\" height=\"23\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">本模組將為您的遊戲增添多種全新的裝飾性光源，從串燈到夜燈一應俱全！<br><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a_4T-7BOqCY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"325\" height=\"325\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mnnbI3S.png\" width=\"115\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Josh/Joosh - 美術設計<br>samgj15 - 程式編寫<br>flechazo098 - 程式編寫<br><strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZtjUq8p.png\" width=\"293\" height=\"23\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creatures-and-beasts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creatures and Beasts</a></strong>&nbsp;- 為 Minecraft 增添驚奇生物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/critters-and-companions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Critters and Companions</a></strong> - 為遊戲增添多種友善動物的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ghost\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ghost</a></strong>&nbsp;- 為你的世界增添兩種友善的幽靈生物！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golem-overhaul\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Golem Overhaul</a></strong> - 新增 9 種全新傀儡類型的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lookin-sharp\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lookin' Sharp</a></strong>&nbsp;- 為遊戲增添 60 種全新近戰武器的模組！<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creeper-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Creeper Overhaul</a>&nbsp;</strong>- 全面改造原版苦力怕的模組！&nbsp;<br><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enderman-overhaul\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enderman Overhaul</a></strong> - 全面改造原版終界使者的模組！&nbsp;<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ribbits\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Ribbits</strong></a>&nbsp;- 新增充滿名為「Ribbits」的微小人型居民的沼澤村落！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sGwxnFV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T4ltmGW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Joosh7889\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ewzK3Zb.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCUvb1-kBGDEA1gVtd3UhlLg/videos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EirVdtZ.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fbonsaistudios\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/AEfwGvx.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmcmodels.net%252fvendors%252f29%252fjoosh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/pXWpwIb.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jjiWlso.png\" width=\"879\" height=\"273\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Hu0Djdp.png\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcloudnord.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nLUVuvA.png\" width=\"844\" height=\"275\"></a></p>",
